  "title": "Sinclair Declares $0.25 per Share Quarterly Cash Dividend - Sinclair, Inc",
  "summary": "BALTIMORE, April 30, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Sinclair, Inc. (Nasdaq: SBGI) announced that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.25 per share on the Company’s Class A and Class B common stock. The dividend is payable on June 09, 2026, to the holders of record at the close of business...",
